OL,10,     Fweapon?
OL,11,G1700 Hitler: Countdown to War
OL,12,     FFresh from invading
OL,13,     FCzechoslovakia, Hitler turned to
OL,14,     Fhis next target - Poland. He saw
OL,15,     Fit this vast country as ripe for
OL,16,     FGerman expansion, taking him to
OL,17,     Fthe borders of the Soviet Union.
