OL,5,G2000 Michael Palin: Travels of a
OL,6,G     Lifetime
OL,7,     FNew. Michael Palin looks back on
OL,8,     Fthe making of Pole to Pole, in
OL,9,     Fwhich he travelled along a single
OL,10,     Fline of longitude across the USSR,
OL,11,     FAfrica and finally into
OL,12,     FAntarctica.
OL,13,G2100 Simon Reeve's South America
OL,14,     FThe adventurer travels to the vast
OL,15,     Fwhite salt flats of Bolivia,
OL,16,     Fthrough the world's greatest
OL,17,     Fwetlands of Brazil's Pantanal, and
OL,18,     Fon to the forested heart of
OL,19,     FParaguay.
